ative, b&gt; לָבְּךָ לוּחַ Prov 3:3 ; 7:3 (for writing wise counsel), compare Jer 17:1 (inscribing sin of Judah); (verb mostly כָּחַב Exod 31:18 b; 32:15 ; Deut 9:10 ; ׳כ עַל Exod 34:1 , 28 ; Deut 4:13 ; 5:19 ; 10:2 , 4 ; Prov 3:3 ; 7:3 ; Isa 30:8 ; עַל חָרַשׁ Jer 17:1 ; כָּרַת followed by accusative Deut 9:9 compare 1Kin 8:9 2Chr 5:10 ; עַל חָרַת Exod 32:16 ; עַל בֵּאֵר Hab 2:2 ). 2 wooden boards , composing altar of tabernacle Exod 27:8 ; 38:7 ; planks composing ship (figurative of Tyre) Ezek 27:5 ; cf, אָ֑רֶז לוּחַ עָלָיהָ נָצוּר Song 8:9 , of door. 3 (metal) plates on bases of lavers in Solomon's temple 1Kin 7:36 .","rootNote":"or לֻחַ ; from a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 7 36","keyReferences":["1Kgs 7 36","1Kgs 8 9","2Chr 5 10","Deut 4 13","Deut 5 22","Deut 9 9","Deut 9 9","Deut 9 10"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":43,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 7 36","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/לֻּחֹת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 9","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לֻח֣וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"2Chr 5 10","book":"2Chr","chapter":5,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/לֻּח֔וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 4 13","book":"Deut","chapter":4,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לֻח֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Deut 5 22","book":"Deut","chapter":5,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לֻחֹ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Deut 9 9","book":"Deut","chapter":9,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לוּחֹ֤ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Deut 9 9","book":"Deut","chapter":9,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לוּחֹ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Deut 9 10","book":"De